            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.7748/ns.31.5.66.s47</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In areas where weight management services are not established, an integrated approach is required to sustain results. This article in Primary Health Care suggests using a stepped care approach using a model such as SHINE (Self, Help, Independence, Nutrition and Exercise). This model can be used to provide a holistic and integrative care pathway for children and young people with severe obesity.</AbstractText>
